      <abstract id="aspace_a2b0be73779e3a41e08c084f5bdc2350">Collection contains photocopies of hand–corrected typescripts of poetry and offprints of articles from poet and journalist Max Barth.</abstract>
      <physloc id="aspace_005ece595e2bdb2631bba5be0e35f1fd">The materials are located onsite in the department.</physloc>
      <langmaterial>
        <language langcode="eng" scriptcode="Latn">English</language>
